#: ../../../changelog.md:889
msgid "v0.18.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:893
msgid ""
"Added `@aliases.return_command` decorator to eliminate the need to wrap the "
"logic for modifying command into callable alias wrapper (#5473)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:896
msgid "Tutorial: added example of callable environment variable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:897
msgid ""
"tools: added `mkdir` to `xonsh.tools.chdir` e.g. `with chdir('/tmp/new', "
"mkdir=True): pass`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:899
msgid ""
"env: Added `$XONSH_MODE` variable to detect the current execution mode: "
"`interactive`, `script_from_file`, `source`, `single_command`, "
"`script_from_stdin`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:902
msgid "Builtin: `exit` can return exit code e.g. `exit 71`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:903
msgid ""
"builtin: added `__xonsh__.imp` to have an ability to import and use modules "
"immediately in one line e.g. `__xonsh__.json.loads('{}')`. In the future "
"`__xonsh__` will have short notation `@` and the line will looks more "
"elegant `@.imp.json.loads('{}')`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:907
msgid "builtins: Added color to printx e.g. `printx('Good', color='GREEN')`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:909
msgid ""
"aliases: Added ability to set multiple decorator aliases e.g. `j = $(@json "
"@noerr echo '{}')`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:911
msgid ""
"Created `xonsh.api` to use xonsh functionality in pure python code and "
"downstream projects (#5383 #5538). It\\'s usable but don\\'t treat this "
"serios because it\\'s mostly to move some functions into distinct submodule "
"to reflect the intention to have the API. We need review and improvements "
"here."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:919
msgid ""
"New executable resolving method was introduced and the commands_cache usages "
"were replaced in the key places. As result we expect speed up in xonsh "
"startup, reducing lagging during typing in prompt and speed ups during the "
"commands execution (#5544 by \\@anki-code)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:924
msgid ""
"`COLOR_RESULTS` switched to `False` for non-interactive command case to "
"improve speed in default behavior (#5562)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:926
msgid "main: Importing sqlite became optional."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:927
msgid ""
"prompt: Switching to prompt_toolkit in edge case of sending stdin to "
"interactive mode (#5462 #5517)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:929
msgid ""
"Rename: `SpecModifier`, `xthread`, `xunthread` renamed to `DecoratorAlias`, "
"`@thread`, `@unthread` to support idea that spec modifier is like a Python "
"decorator."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:932
msgid ""
"Big refactoring of internal modules structure to give clear understanding of "
"internal xonsh components (#5538). E.g. if you have `import xonsh.jobs` "
"convert this to `import xonsh.procs.jobs`. This kind of refactoring occurs "
"once per many years."
msgstr ""

