#: ../../../changelog.md:974
msgid ""
"Added section \\\"Use the Nix Package manager with Xonsh\\\" to \\\"Platform-"
"specific tips and tricks\\\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:976
msgid ""
"Added `env.detype_all()` to get all available variables that is possible to "
"detype."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:978
msgid ""
"Reading stop signals from the process and update the process state (#5361)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:980
msgid "Added support of NixOS core tools in `predict_threadable`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:981
msgid ""
"Added catching an exceptions during load a history backend to avoid shell "
"exiting e.g. on permission error."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:983
msgid "Added catching an exception when cache file is not writable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:984
msgid "Added FuncAlias to process callable aliases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:985
msgid "Added alias name printing in case of exception in alias."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:986
msgid "Saving history in case of any type of exiting the shell."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:987
msgid ""
"Added catching ChildProcessError in jobs. Avoiding hanging aliases in some "
"cases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:989
msgid ""
"Added xonsh support into Jupytext project! Jupytext is to store Jupyter "
"notebooks as a plain text documents."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:991
msgid "Now last executed CommandPipeline is available in `__xonsh__.last`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:992
msgid ""
"Added `xonsh --no-env` option to run xonsh without inheriting the "
"environment variables. Now by running `xonsh --no-rc --no-env` you have pure "
"xonsh session."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:995
msgid ""
"Added thread class, name, func and alias names to thread exception for easy "
"understanding the source of issue."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:997
msgid "Added shortcut `-st` for `--shell-type`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:998
msgid ""
"Saving history on SIGINT. Development tools like PyCharm send SIGINT before "
"killing the run and doing this is the last chance to save history."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:1001
msgid ""
"Added `spec.raise_subproc_error` for fine-tuning exceptions via "
"`SpecModifierAlias` (#5494)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:1003
msgid ""
"Added `$XONSH_SUBPROC_OUTPUT_FORMAT` to switch the way to return the output "
"lines. Default `stream_lines` to return text. Alternative `list_lines` to "
"return the list of lines. Now you can run `du $(ls)` without additional "
"stripping. Also supported custom lambda function to process lines (if "
"you\\'re looking for alternative to bash IFS)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:1008
msgid ""
"Added `xthread` and `xunthread` aliases to force command running as threaded "
"and unthreaded."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:1010
msgid ""
"Added `SpecModifierAlias` class to have an ability to create alias that "
"modifies spec before run e.g. `xthread` alias."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:1012
msgid ""
"Added mode `$XONSH_TRACE_SUBPROC=3` to show more information about pipeline."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:1014
msgid "Added \\\"Callable alias and capturing\\\" to the tutorial."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:1015
msgid ""
"Xonfig: show sensitive env variables that could affect the shell behavior."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:1017
msgid ""
"We started [Zulip Community](https://xonsh.zulipchat.com/join/"
"hbvue5rimpdkwkdjuiqfs7tv/) to publish news and chatting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:1023
msgid "Minor cleanup of `commands_cache`, unifying behavior across platforms."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:1025
msgid ""
"Xonsh AppImage downgraded to Python 3.11. We need to resolve 3.12 parser "
"support (5166) before upgrade."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:1027
msgid ""
"Env variables completion: now use substring for search and then sort results "
"by the position of substring and then alphabetically. PR 5388."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:1030
msgid "jobs: default representation changed to dict."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:1031
msgid ""
"The CommandPipeline repr will not show descriptors by default. Use "
"XONSH_DEBUG mode to see them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:1033
msgid "Prompt: `env_name` will have yellow color by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:1034
msgid "Show `root` and `@#` in prompt if user is superuser."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:1035
msgid ""
"Cleaning logic and functions around threading and capturing in `procs/specs."
"py` file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:1037
msgid ""
"Now the ending new line symbol `\\n` will be stripped from the single line "
"output. For `$(whoami)` you will get `'user'` instead of `'user\\n'`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:1040
msgid "`$XONSH_TRACE_SUBPROC=2` returns more useful details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:1041
msgid ""
"The home based `~/.xonshrc` will not be executed in non-interactive mode "
"(#5491)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:1046
msgid ""
