#: ../../../changelog.md:5141
msgid ""
"New `color_tools` module provides basic color tools for converting to and "
"from various formats as well as creating palettes from color strings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5144
msgid "Redirections may now be used in string and list-of-strings aliases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5145
msgid ""
"Subprocess redirection may now forego the whitespace between the redirection "
"and a file name. For example, `echo hello world >/dev/null`."
