msgid "`@(...)` syntax now supports generators and tuples without parentheses."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5154
msgid ""
"Sourcing foreign shells now have the `--show` option, which lets you see "
"when script will be run, and the `--dryrun` option which prevents the source "
"from actually taking place. Xonsh\\'s foreign shell API also added these "
"keyword arguments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5158
msgid ""
"Subprocess mode now supports subshells. Place any xonsh code between two "
"parentheses, e.g. `(cmd)`, to run this command in a separate xonsh "
"subprocess."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5161
msgid ""
"Foreign shell aliases now have the ability to take extra arguments, if "
"needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5163
msgid ""
"Xonsh will issue a warning message when the current working directory has "
"been remove out from under it and not replaced prior to running the next "
"command."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5166
msgid ""
"Line continuation backslashes are respected on Windows in the PTK shell if "
"the backspace is is preceded by a space."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5168
msgid ""
"Added `ponysay` as a command which will usually not run in a threaded mode "
"in the commands cache."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5170
msgid ""
"New `jsonutils` module available for serializing special xonsh objects to "
"JSON."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5175
msgid ""
"The literal tokens `and` and `or` must be surrounded by whitespace to "
"delimit subprocess mode. If they do not have whitespace on both sides in "
"subproc mode, they are considered to be part of a command argument."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5179
msgid ""
"The `xontrib` command is now flagged as unthreadable and will be run on the "
"main Python thread. This allows xontribs to set signal handlers and other "
"operations that require the main thread."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5182
msgid "nvim (Neovim) has been flagged as unthreadable"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5183
msgid ""
"The interactive prompt will now catch `SystemExit` and, instead of exiting "
"the session, will refresh the prompt. This is the same process as for "
"keyboard interrupts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5186
msgid ""
"Xonsh no longer launches the wizard for new users. Instead a welcome screen "
"is shown which says how to launch the wizard."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5188
msgid ""
"Added Windows `expanduser()`-like function which prevents the expansion of "
"`~` that are not followed by a path separator."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5190
msgid ""
"Collecting xonsh history files was reported to have random runtime OSError "
"failures. This exception is now handled, just in case. The The exception "
"will still be printed in debug mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5193
msgid "`Shell.stype` has been renamed to `Shell.shell_type`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5194
msgid ""
"The configuration wizard now displays the proper control sequence to leave "
"the wizard at the to start of the wizard itself. Note that this is Ctrl+D "
"for readline and Ctrl+C for prompt-toolkit."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5197
msgid ""
"Callable alias proxy functions are now more friendly to `functools."
"partial()`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5199
msgid ""
"`prompt.vc.get_hg_branch` now uses `os.scandir` to walk up the filetree "
"looking for a `.hg` directory. This results in (generally) faster branch "
"resolution compared to the subprocess call to `hg root`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5203
msgid ""
"Xonsh\\'s script and code caches will are now invalidated whenever the xonsh "
"version changes for a given Python version."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5205
msgid ""
"Autowrapping of subprocess globs has been improved to cover more cases that "
"are ambiguous with Python syntax."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5207
msgid ""
"Job control info when foregrounding or backgrounding jobs will now only be "
"displayed when xonsh is in interactive mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5209
msgid ""
"Enabled virtual terminal processing in the prompt-toolkit shell for Windows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5214
msgid ""
"3rd party pygments styles (like solorized or monokailight) are now able to "
"be used in xonsh. These styles are dynamically created upon first use, "
"rather than being lazily loaded by xonsh."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5217
msgid ""
"On Windows, `os.environ` is case insensitive. This would potentially change "
"the case of environment variables set into the environment. Xonsh now uses "
"`nt.environ`, the case sensitive counterpart, to avoid these issues on "
"Windows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5221
msgid "Fix how `$PWD` is managed in order to work with symlinks gracefully"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5222
msgid ""
"`history replay` no longer barfs on `style_name` when setting up the "
"environment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5224
msgid ""
"`Shell.shell_type` is now properly set to the same value as `$SHELL_TYPE`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5226
msgid "Fixed `source-zsh` to work with zsh v5.2."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5227
msgid "Fixed issue where `del (x, y)` would raise a syntax error."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5228
msgid ""
"Certain vim commands issue commands involving subshells, and this is now "
"supported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5230
msgid ""
"Null bytes handed to Popen are now automatically escaped prior to running a "
"subprocess. This prevents Popen from issuing embedded null byte exceptions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5233
msgid ""
"Xonsh will no longer crash is the current working directory is removed out "
"from under it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5235
msgid "Multiline strings can now be written in subprocess mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5236
msgid ""
"PTK completions will now correctly deduplicate autosuggest completions and "
"display completions values based on the cursor position."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5239
msgid ""
"Fixed bug where trailing backspaces on Windows paths could be interpreted as "
"line continuations characters. Now line continuation characters must be "
"preceded by a space on Windows. This only applies to xonsh in interactive "
"mode to ensure scripts are portable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5243
msgid ""
"Importing `*.xsh` files will now respect the encoding listed in that file "
"and properly fallback to UTF-8. This behaviour follows the rules described "
"in PEP 263."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5246
msgid "Wizard is now able to properly serialize environment paths."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:5248
msgid "v0.5.6"
msgstr ""

