#: ../../../changelog.md:6335
msgid ""
"A new class, `xonsh.tools.EnvPath` has been added. This class implements a "
"`MutableSequence` object and overrides the `__getitem__` method so that when "
"its entries are requested (either explicitly or implicitly), variable and "
"user expansion is performed, and relative paths are resolved. `EnvPath` "
"accepts objects (or lists of objects) of `str`, `bytes` or `pathlib.Path` "
"types."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:6342
msgid ""
"New amalgamate tool collapses modules inside of a package into a single "
"`__amalgam__.py` module. This tool glues together all of the code from the "
"modules in a package, finds and removes intra-package imports, makes all non-"
"package imports lazy, and adds hooks into the `__init__.py`. This helps "
"makes initial imports of modules fast and decreases startup time. Packages "
"and sub-packages must be amalgamated separately."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:6350
msgid ""
"New lazy and self-destructive module `xonsh.lazyasd` adds a suite of classes "
"for delayed creation of objects."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:6353
msgid "A `LazyObject` won\\'t be created until it has an attribute accessed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:6355
msgid "A `LazyDict` will load each value only when a key is accessed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:6356
msgid "A `LazyBool` will only be created when `__bool__()` is called."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:6358
msgid ""
"Additionally, when fully loaded, the above objects will replace themselves "
"by name in the context that they were handed, thus dereferencing themselves. "
"This is useful for global variables that may be expensive to create, should "
"only be created once, and may not be used in any particular session."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:6364
msgid ""
"New `xon.sh` script added for launching xonsh from a sh environment. This "
