msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:6666
msgid "Fixed issue with the xonsh.ply subpackage not being installed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.md:6667
msgid ""
"Fixed a parsing bug whereby a trailing `&` on a line was being ignored "
